{
  "$schema": "https://evorule.org/schemas/rule_set/v1.0.json",
  "kind": "rule_set",
  "id": "org.evorule.core.eval",
  "rule_id": "core.eval",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "TCB 最小引擎自评估集（原子计算+控制流+兜底）；ReAct 应用剧本已整体迁出至消费方自持（T8,2026-08-27），应用可参照 app.evoagent.agent v0.4.0 范式",
  "metadata": {
    "author": "evorule-core",
    "license": "CC0-1.0 Universal (Public Domain)",
    "public_domain_notice": "本文件(core_eval.json,即 EvoRule 宪法)以 CC0 1.0 公共领域奉献。任何人都可以自由使用、修改、再分发,无需保留版权声明。EvoRule 代码本身采用 AGPL-3.0-or-later,但本解释器规范是公共领域 —— 任何人都可以实现兼容的 EvoRule 引擎。",
    "spdx_license_id": "CC0-1.0",
    "provenance": {
      "note": "v0.3.1 及此前版本含 ReAct 循环规则(call_external/call_service 剧本),2026-08-27 经 T8 专项迁出至消费方;机制层(6 元指令/9 指令类型/has_fields 等域函数)始终属于语言规范,不受本次迁出影响"
    },
    "sections": [
      "1. 原子计算指令: increment, decrement, set",
      "2. 控制流指令: sequence, conditional, while_loop",
      "3. 默认处理: all([]) 兜底规则"
    ],
    "constraints": [
      "每条 transform 规则中最多包含一个 io_request 元指令",
      "原因: __io_results__ 是按 io_type 隔离的字段，多个 io_request 会冲突",
      "io_request 必须是 branch 的叶子节点（on_false 分支），之前不能有 set/push 操作",
      "v0.3.0 新增: has_fields 域类型、collect 元指令、merge 元指令（语言层能力，本最小集未使用但引擎持续支持）",
      "设计决策: fork-join 批处理聚合已整体移除——批处理策略违反 TCB 最小顺序语义，多工具的 token 聚合优化由 governance 层负责",
      "I/O 结果按类型隔离: __io_results__.{io_type}；消费后以 JSON null 清除（exists 将 null 视为不存在）",
      "v0.3.1: set 的 attr 引用 payload 内以 __ 开头的字段时必须写显式前缀（如 __exec__.payload.__io_results__.call_external），否则会被误判为状态根路径",
      "本版撤销兼容说明: query_db/http_get/save_memory 不再是内置指令类型（宪法未定义对应 transform 规则，提交会触发显式警告——TCB 层检测到 noop 效果返回 TransitionResult::Ignored，反应器产生 Error 事实）；需要这些能力的应用在其自有 rule_set 中定义 call_service 类规则",
      "本版 call_external 参数: 仅使用 messages（LLM 消息历史数组）与 tools（可选工具描述）；prompt/system 不再作为指令参数（live handler 可直接从 messages 透传）。注意: 本最小评估集不定义 call_external 规则,需 LLM 循环的应用自带剧本（范式见 app.evoagent.agent）",
      "语义澄清: 业务 set 指令为纯覆盖语义——宪法规则硬编码元指令 operation=set，指令 params 中的 operation 字段（如 add/sub）被忽略；算术更新必须使用 increment（add）/decrement（sub）指令。误用 set+add 做循环体累加会导致计数器每轮被覆盖回常量、while_loop 条件永真（差分测试回归教训）"
    ]
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "increment"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "add",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.delta"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "decrement"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "sub",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.delta"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "set"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "set",
            "params": {
              "attr": "__exec__.instruction.params.attr",
              "operation": "set",
              "value": "__exec__.instruction.params.value"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "sequence"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "push",
            "params": {
              "instructions": "__exec__.instruction.params.instructions"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "conditional"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": "__exec__.instruction.params.domain",
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.then"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.else"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "instruction",
          "instruction_type": "while_loop"
        },
        "on_true": [
          {
            "type": "branch",
            "params": {
              "domain": "__exec__.instruction.params.condition",
              "on_true": [
                {
                  "type": "push",
                  "params": {
                    "instructions": [
                      "__exec__.instruction.params.body",
                      "__exec__.instruction"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "on_false": []
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": { "type": "instruction", "instruction_type": "noop" },
        "on_true": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "branch",
      "params": {
        "domain": { "type": "all", "inner": [] },
        "on_true": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
